---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';

const personSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "Mizanur Rahaman",
  "jobTitle": "Shopify & Frontend Development Expert, Founder",
  "url": "https://pixelquil.com/about/",
  "worksFor": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Pixelquil"
  },
  "knowsAbout": [
    "Shopify Development",
    "Conversion Rate Optimization",
    "Figma to Code",
    "GemPages",
    "PageFly",
    "Replo",
    "SVG Optimization",
    "Frontend Development",
    "Technical SEO",
    "JavaScript",
    "CSS3",
    "HTML5"
  ],
  "nationality": "Bangladeshi",
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "addressLocality": "Chattogram",
    "addressCountry": "Bangladesh"
  }
};
---

<MainLayout
  title="About"
  description="Meet Mizanur Rahaman, the developer behind Pixelquil. Built on 5+ years of production experience, 480+ completed client projects, and real frontend optimization work."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(personSchema)} />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      About Pixelquil
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
      Built by an experienced developer focused on real performance
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Pixelquil is built and maintained by Mizanur Rahaman, a Top Rated frontend and Shopify development expert based in Chattogram, Bangladesh. With over 5 years of professional experience, 1700 plus logged engineering hours, and more than 480 completed web projects, every utility here reflects real production needs rather than theoretical exercises.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600">
        MR
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Mizanur Rahaman</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Shopify Expert & Frontend Developer, Chattogram, Bangladesh</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600">Top Rated Freelancer • 480+ Web Projects Completed</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Why Pixelquil exists</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Across hundreds of live store implementations and Figma design conversions, the same technical friction occurred repeatedly. SVG graphics exported from design software frequently contained redundant code, missing viewports, or incorrect color values. Page setup often required quick metadata checks or code formatting without firing up heavy development suites.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Many existing online tools were slow, bloated with popups, or uploaded user graphics to distant servers without clear privacy guarantees. Pixelquil provides lightweight, browser based alternatives that solve these daily workflow obstacles instantly.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Production experience background</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      My daily engineering work involves translating complex Figma mockups into fully custom Shopify layouts, utilizing page builders such as GemPages, PageFly, and Replo, alongside modern HTML5, CSS3, and custom JavaScript. Working on conversion rate optimization for global brands requires meticulous attention to mobile loading speed, DOM efficiency, and rendering accuracy.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      This practical store building experience directly informs Pixelquil. The guidance, validation rules, and tool functions are calibrated around actual browser requirements and search engine recommendations.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Core principles of this platform</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-slate-600">
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span><strong class="text-slate-900">Browser execution privacy.</strong> Processing happens locally inside your browser session. Your input data, graphics, and code snippets remain strictly private.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span><strong class="text-slate-900">Instant utility access.</strong> Core tools work without mandatory registration or account setups.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span><strong class="text-slate-900">Verified technical guidance.</strong> Every tool page features practical explanations derived from working site implementations, not automated text generation.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 p-6 border border-brand-100">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
        Have suggestions, discovered an edge case issue, or want to discuss a custom web tool concept? Get in touch through the 
        <a href="/contact/" class="font-medium text-brand-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>